ew_receiver_learn.description:
**STEP 1:** Put receiver into learning mode

{mode_instructions}

**Procedure:**
1. Press the learn button on the Easywave Receiver
2. LED should flash (learning mode active)
3. Confirm with 'OK' when learning mode is active

**Configuration:**
- Device: {device_name}
- RX11 Index: {rx11_index}
- Type: {receiver_kind}
- Mode: {operating_mode}

ew_receiver_final_confirm.description:
**FINAL CONFIRMATION:**

The Easywave Receiver is ready for creation:

**Device Data:**
- Name: {device_name}
- RX11 Index: {rx11_index}
- Type: {receiver_kind}
- Operating Mode: {operating_mode}
- Number of Buttons: {button_count}

**Available Functions:**
{button_summary}

⚠️ **Important:** The communication test will be performed during creation.

